{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"[Onayl\u0131 mod \u2014 test g\u00f6nderimi] App\u2019in TEST C\u0130HAZLARINA ger\u00e7ek bir test push\u2019u g\u00f6nderir (ger\u00e7ek kitleye asla). `subscription_ids` verilirse hepsi test cihaz\u0131 olmal\u0131d\u0131r. API anahtar\u0131nda `mcp:write` kapsam\u0131 olmal\u0131d\u0131r; \u00e7a\u011f\u0131rmadan \u00f6nce kullan\u0131c\u0131dan a\u00e7\u0131k onay al\u0131n.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"app_id":{"description":"App kimli\u011fi (app_\u2026). App\u2019e ba\u011fl\u0131 anahtarda veya varsay\u0131lan app tan\u0131ml\u0131ysa gerekmez.","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^(?!\\.{1,2}$)[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]+$","type":"string"},"contents":{"additionalProperties":{"maxLength":4000,"type":"string"},"description":"Dile g\u00f6re metin, \u00f6r. {\"tr\":\"Merhaba\",\"en\":\"Hello\"}.","propertyNames":{"maxLength":10,"minLength":2,"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"data":{"additionalProperties":{"maxLength":1000,"type":"string"},"propertyNames":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"headings":{"additionalProperties":{"maxLength":4000,"type":"string"},"description":"Dile g\u00f6re metin, \u00f6r. {\"tr\":\"Merhaba\",\"en\":\"Hello\"}.","propertyNames":{"maxLength":10,"minLength":2,"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"subscription_ids":{"description":"Belirli test cihazlar\u0131 (bo\u015fsa t\u00fcm test cihazlar\u0131).","items":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"url":{"format":"uri","maxLength":2000,"type":"string"}},"required":["contents"],"type":"object"},"name":"send_test_notification","title":"Test cihazlar\u0131na test g\u00f6nder"}
